<title>POLAND: UNIVERSAL GROUP NET UP AT PLN 33.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>UNIVERSAL GROUP NET UP AT PLN 33.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary Universal results</p>
<p>for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	  1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	     22.03  vs    13.99</p>
